    Returns an output of type: number
- compute_range_tool: Compute the numerical range (``max(values) – min(values)``) of *values*.
    Takes inputs: {'values': {'type': 'array', 'items': {'type': 'number'}, 'description': 'A list of numeric values.'}}
    Returns an output of type: number
